BBUUGGSS
     Since NFSv4 performs open/lock operations that have their ordering
     strictly enforced by the server, the options iinnttrr and ssoofftt cannot be
     safely used.  For NFSv4 minor version 1 or 2 mounts, the ordering is done
     via session slots and the NFSv4 client now handles broken session slots
     fairly well.  As such, if the nnoolloocckkdd option is used along with iinnttrr
     and/or ssoofftt, an NFSv4 minor version 1 or 2 mount should work fairly well,
     although still not completely correctly.  For NFSv4 minor version 0
     mounts, hhaarrdd mounts without the iinnttrr mount option is strongly recom‐
     mended.

